  "content": "<p>Для версии Forge <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/revived-farmers-delight-crops-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">здесь</a></strong>.</p><p>Также доступно на <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frevived-farmers-delight-crops-3d-for-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong></p><p>Это версия для Fabric к&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/revived-farmers-delight-crops-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>REVIVED Farmer's Delight crops 3D</strong></a>.</p><p>Этот ресурспак предоставляет 3D-модели культур для следующих модов:</p><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight Refabricated</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight Refabricated</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/my-nethers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">My Nether's Delight Refabricated</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite (Fabric)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corn-delight-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corn Delight [Fabric/Quilt]</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Предложения и отчёты можно отправлять через&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScfSBV6_frlwlOsyyyIfXpRptl2VmqYNKy99Gl55r4tPGPtmw/viewform?usp=sf_link\" rel=\"nofollow\">формы</a></span> и <span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/uTDu7K3Ezn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span></strong></p>",
